OL,3,AAt least 33 pupils and teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter school roof collapses in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the BBC the roof of an
OL,7,Fupper-floor classroom had collapsed,
OL,8,Fcausing ceilings below to cave in as
OL,9,Fwell.
